Data availability

            The data for farms and field trials used in this study are available on figshare at https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.32529207 (ref. 49). Climate data during maize-growing seasons are available from the WorldClim database (www.worldclim.org). Source data are provided with this paper.
          Code availability

            This study used R software (version 4.3.2) with relevant packages for data analysis. Source codes are available on figshare at https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.32539239 (ref. 50).
